# Replace port with api-gateway's HTTP endpoint shown in Aspire.
@gateway = http://localhost:17320
@identity = {{gateway}}/identity
@adminIdentity = {{gateway}}/admin-identity
@customers = {{gateway}}/customers
@accessToken = paste-customer-rs256-access-token-here
@adminAccessToken = paste-admin-rs256-access-token-here
@customerId = paste-guid-from-token-sub-here

### Gateway health and OIDC/BFF metadata
GET {{gateway}}/health

###
GET {{gateway}}/gateway-info

### Customer OIDC discovery and public RSA JWKS
GET {{identity}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

###
GET {{identity}}/.well-known/jwks

### Admin OIDC discovery and public RSA JWKS (distinct issuer & RSA signing key)
GET {{adminIdentity}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

###
GET {{adminIdentity}}/.well-known/jwks

### Public administrator SSO shell (initiates Authorization Code + PKCE via GET /auth/login)
GET {{gateway}}/login

### Check current Gateway OIDC BFF session state
GET {{gateway}}/auth/session

### Register a customer through YARP -> Customer Identity (stored in identitydb)
POST {{identity}}/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway-user@example.com",
  "password": "Correct-horse-123!"
}

### Exchange OAuth 2.1 Authorization Code + PKCE (S256) for Customer RS256 tokens
### (Obtain code via GET/POST {{identity}}/connect/authorize or run ../Davids/scripts/Test-Infrastructure.ps1)
POST {{identity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&client_id=davids-web&code=paste-auth-code&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Fcallback&code_verifier=paste-pkce-verifier

### Current customer through the gateway (/me and OIDC /connect/userinfo)
GET {{identity}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{identity}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Current administrator identity
GET {{adminIdentity}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### List administrator accounts (stored exclusively in adminidentitydb)
GET {{adminIdentity}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Provision a new administrator account (admin-only; no public /sign-up)
POST {{adminIdentity}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ops-admin@davids.local",
  "password": "Strong-Admin-Password-2026!",
  "fullName": "Operations Administrator"
}

### Search and filter customers (administrator)
GET {{customers}}?search=john&state=valid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Customer details (profile is provisioned asynchronously from identity signed_up event)
GET {{customers}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Complete the current user's customer profile
POST {{customers}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "fullname": "John Doe",
  "address": "New York City, Street XYZ"
}

### Edit a customer record (administrator)
PUT {{customers}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "fullName": "John A. Doe",
  "email": "gateway-user@example.com",
  "address": "42 Broadway, New York, NY",
  "state": "valid"
}
